{"item_uid": "學測94-chinese-001", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 1, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列各組「」內的字，讀音完全相同的選項是：", "options": {"A": "「狙」擊／崩「殂」", "B": "結「痂」／「袈」裟", "C": "標「籤」／一語成「讖」", "D": "「溽」暑／深耕易「耨」"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C（或A）", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 3.0, "B": 74.0, "C": 10.0, "D": 12.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 92.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 5.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 7.0, "B": 52.0, "C": 19.0, "D": 21.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 74.0, "p_high": 92.0, "p_low": 52.0, "discrimination": 40.0, "p_quintiles": [94.0, 87.0, 78.0, 67.0, 44.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測94-chinese-002", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 2, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列文句，完全沒有錯別字的選項是：", "options": {"A": "板橋地方法院的檢察官日前受理一起兄弟鬩牆案，由於是公訴案件，所以雙\n方沒有和解的轉還空間", "B": "中華職棒牛獅激戰，高潮疊起，在球員們咬牙力拚下，興農牛擊敗統一獅，\n奪下創隊以來首次總冠軍", "C": "部分餐館以廉價牛肉充當高級牛排，媒體揭發之後，業者卻以「拼裝牛排」\n強加辯解，此種塘塞卸責之說詞，令人無法苟同", "D": "南亞海嘯造成重大傷亡，無情巨浪吞噬數十萬人的生命，倖存的災民除遭親\n人離散之痛，尚得面對滿目瘡痍的家園，處境極為艱難"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 8.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 11.0, "D": 74.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 4.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 84.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 11.0, "B": 14.0, "C": 13.0, "D": 61.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 74.0, "p_high": 84.0, "p_low": 61.0, "discrimination": 23.0, "p_quintiles": [87.0, 80.0, 75.0, 70.0, 56.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測94-chinese-003", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 3, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列各組詩歌中，前後都各有一含「來」字的語詞，其中「來」字意義不同的\n選項是：", "options": {"A": "年皆過半百，來日苦無多／往者不可諫，來者猶可追", "B": "別來春半，觸目愁腸斷／古來聖賢皆寂寞，唯有飲者留其名", "C": "微雨從東來，好風與之俱／無邊落木蕭蕭下，不盡長江滾滾來", "D": "歸來彷彿三更，家僮鼻息已雷鳴／爾來四萬八千歲，不與秦塞通人煙"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 17.0, "B": 26.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 49.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 8.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 70.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 25.0, "B": 31.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 30.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 49.0, "p_high": 70.0, "p_low": 30.0, "discrimination": 40.0, "p_quintiles": [76.0, 59.0, 48.0, 38.0, 26.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測94-chinese-004", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 4, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "「（曹植）善屬文，太祖嘗視其文，謂植曰：『汝倩人邪？』植跪曰：『言出\n為論，下筆成章，顧當面試，奈何倩人？』」「倩人」一詞，從上下文意推敲，\n其意應為：", "options": {"A": "請人代筆", "B": "模擬他人名作", "C": "文章講求漂亮辭藻", "D": "文章有女性陰柔之美"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 57.0, "B": 26.0, "C": 10.0, "D": 7.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 77.0, "B": 19.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 34.0, "B": 31.0, "C": 20.0, "D": 15.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 57.0, "p_high": 77.0, "p_low": 34.0, "discrimination": 43.0, "p_quintiles": [80.0, 70.0, 60.0, 48.0, 27.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測94-chinese-005", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 5, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "儒家著重德行、理想的追求，反對物質生活的耽溺，下列《論語》引文中，並\n非陳述此種意旨的選項是：", "options": {"A": "君子憂道不憂貧", "B": "士而懷居，不足以為士矣", "C": "奢則不孫，儉則固；與其不孫也，寧固", "D": "士志於道，而恥惡衣惡食者，未足與議也"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 6.0, "B": 44.0, "C": 40.0, "D": 10.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 5.0, "B": 34.0, "C": 57.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 8.0, "B": 49.0, "C": 25.0, "D": 17.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 40.0, "p_high": 57.0, "p_low": 25.0, "discrimination": 32.0, "p_quintiles": [63.0, 46.0, 36.0, 29.0, 25.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測94-chinese-006", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 6, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列引文，依文意推敲， 內最適宜填入的選項是：\n「我客居在＿＿＿＿＿的詩裏／金箔映照著西風中的翠鳥與玉樓／失火的絳唇冷\n去，轔轔的／兵車乍醒如戲／在一片澄黃的語字的景色裏／長安，是不能逼迫\n太甚的玻璃器皿／客來，借酒／春到，看花／群鷗日日的 也好像是廣廈\n千萬了。」", "options": {"A": "王先生（王維）／輞川", "B": "杜先生（杜甫）／草堂", "C": "李先生（李白）／青蓮鄉", "D": "孟先生（孟浩然）／終南山\n- 1 -\n94學年度 第 2 頁\n國文考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 14.0, "B": 36.0, "C": 31.0, "D": 18.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 10.0, "B": 55.0, "C": 25.0, "D": 9.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 17.0, "B": 20.0, "C": 34.0, "D": 29.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 36.0, "p_high": 55.0, "p_low": 20.0, "discrimination": 35.0, "p_quintiles": [62.0, 43.0, 33.0, 24.0, 19.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測94-chinese-007", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 7, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "斟酌下列引文的文意脈絡，□□中最適合填入的選項是：\n「禮是天理與人事之節文與儀則。同理，『藝術是聲和色的節文與儀則。』小貓\n爬到了洋琴的鍵盤上，各種聲音都有，但不成為樂曲。畫家的調色板上，各種\n顏色都有，但不成為畫。何以故？因為祇有聲色而沒有節文與儀則的原故。故\n可知『□□』是造成藝術的一個重要條件。」", "options": {"A": "自由", "B": "摹擬", "C": "節制", "D": "趣味"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 11.0, "B": 22.0, "C": 58.0, "D": 8.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 81.0, "D": 5.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 22.0, "B": 32.0, "C": 33.0, "D": 13.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 58.0, "p_high": 81.0, "p_low": 33.0, "discrimination": 48.0, "p_quintiles": [85.0, 73.0, 62.0, 48.0, 25.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測94-chinese-008", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 8, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "（甲）一飯尚銘恩，況曾褓抱提攜，只少懷胎十月\n千金難報德，即論人情物理，也當泣血三年\n（乙）為人如等邊矩形，處世若一次曲線，哭吾師竟至無窮遠點\n授業有強磁在身，解惑燃乙炔於夜，願先生風範長留人間\n從上述甲乙二輓聯文意判斷，聯中所悼輓的對象分別應是：", "options": {"A": "母親／啟蒙教師", "B": "乳母／數理教師", "C": "祖母／啟蒙教師", "D": "父親／數理教師"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 20.0, "B": 68.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 8.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 8.0, "B": 82.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 7.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 34.0, "B": 50.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 9.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 68.0, "p_high": 82.0, "p_low": 50.0, "discrimination": 32.0, "p_quintiles": [85.0, 77.0, 71.0, 62.0, 44.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測94-chinese-009", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 9, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下引文字，依文意排列，順序最恰當的選項是：\n「屋子裏沒有燈火，\n（甲）沒有線條，也沒有顏色的大輪廓\n（乙）橫順的在黑暗裏爬\n（丙）老人的眼淚在他有縐紋的臉上爬\n（丁）黑暗是一個大輪廓\n（戊）他的眼淚變成了無數的爬蟲子\n個個從老人的內心出發」（蕭紅〈小城三月〉）", "options": {"A": "甲丁戊乙丙", "B": "乙甲丙丁戊", "C": "丙乙戊甲丁", "D": "丁甲丙乙戊"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 17.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 78.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 10.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 89.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 24.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 63.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 78.0, "p_high": 89.0, "p_low": 63.0, "discrimination": 26.0, "p_quintiles": [91.0, 86.0, 81.0, 74.0, 57.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測94-chinese-010", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 10, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "斟酌下列文句，□□中最適合填入的選項是：\n（甲）夏夜，柳絲是些溫寂垂懸的□□，在月光裏睡著（司馬中原〈如歌的行板〉）\n（乙）許多美的人和美的事，錯綜起來像一天□□，而且萬顆奔星似的飛動著，\n同時又展開去，以至於無窮（魯迅〈好的故事〉）\n（丙）我看到紅色羽毛和黃色羽毛的朱鸝鳥，啄著葡萄架上的青葡萄。美麗的朱\n鸝鳥常常成群的飛進院子裡來……一粒粒的青色葡萄在往地上跌落，跌出\n碎細的□□（蕭白〈六月的眸光〉）", "options": {"A": "簾幕／霧靄／耳語", "B": "簾幕／雲錦／珍珠", "C": "睫毛／雲錦／耳語", "D": "睫毛／霧靄／珍珠"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 16.0, "B": 32.0, "C": 37.0, "D": 14.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 13.0, "B": 22.0, "C": 53.0, "D": 13.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 18.0, "B": 44.0, "C": 22.0, "D": 16.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 37.0, "p_high": 53.0, "p_low": 22.0, "discrimination": 31.0, "p_quintiles": [57.0, 44.0, 36.0, 28.0, 18.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測94-chinese-011", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 11, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "「馬穿山徑菊初黃，信馬悠悠野興長。萬壑有聲含晚籟，數峰無語立斜陽。棠\n梨葉落胭脂色，蕎麥花開白雪香。何事吟餘忽惆悵？村橋原樹似吾鄉。」下列\n有關本詩的分析，不正確的選項是：", "options": {"A": "從形式上看，本詩應屬律詩", "B": "詩中所描寫的景色屬於秋景", "C": "全詩句句寫景亦兼寫情，自首至尾流露濃厚的秋之愁緒", "D": "詩人行遊所見，彷彿故鄉景物，所以勾起他惆悵的思鄉情懷\n- 2 -\n第 3 頁 94學年度\n共 7 頁 國文考科"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 22.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 68.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 10.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 88.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 36.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 44.0, "D": 8.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 68.0, "p_high": 88.0, "p_low": 44.0, "discrimination": 44.0, "p_quintiles": [91.0, 82.0, 72.0, 58.0, 37.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測94-chinese-012", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 12, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列文意解釋，正確的選項是：", "options": {"A": "龐恭從邯鄲反，意謂龐恭在邯鄲造反", "B": "今邯鄲之去魏也遠於巿，意謂邯鄲距離巿集很遠", "C": "三人言而成虎，意謂三人言詞機智，實有真知灼見", "D": "龐恭與太子質於邯鄲，意謂龐恭與太子在邯鄲作人質"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "12-13", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 12.0, "B": 22.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 52.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 5.0, "B": 14.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 80.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 17.0, "B": 26.0, "C": 33.0, "D": 24.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 52.0, "p_high": 80.0, "p_low": 24.0, "discrimination": 56.0, "p_quintiles": [85.0, 69.0, 52.0, 36.0, 19.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測94-chinese-013", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 13, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "龐恭所要向魏王闡述的論點是：", "options": {"A": "君子不以人廢言", "B": "人言可畏，眾口鑠金", "C": "三人行，必有我師焉", "D": "街談巷議，語多可採"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "12-13", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 7.0, "B": 87.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 97.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 12.0, "B": 72.0, "C": 10.0, "D": 7.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 87.0, "p_high": 97.0, "p_low": 72.0, "discrimination": 25.0, "p_quintiles": [98.0, 96.0, 92.0, 85.0, 64.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測94-chinese-014", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 14, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "依上引詩歌的詩意判斷，下列敘述正確的選項是：", "options": {"A": "詩人藉反覆「記得」，訴說自然無常、世事多變的感傷", "B": "詩人藉反覆「記得」，描寫由少至今沈浮起落的哀怨記憶", "C": "詩人藉「記得」的不斷強調，表達對一段情緣的深刻懷念", "D": "詩人藉「記得」的不斷強調，流露對年少輕狂時耽溺孽緣的懊悔"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "14-15", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 4.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 86.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 97.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 9.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 70.0, "D": 9.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 86.0, "p_high": 97.0, "p_low": 70.0, "discrimination": 27.0, "p_quintiles": [98.0, 94.0, 91.0, 83.0, 62.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測94-chinese-015", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 15, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列歌詞的詞意，與上引詩中詩人內心深處的情感最為近似的選項是：", "options": {"A": "你不曾真的離去／你始終在我心裡／我對你仍有愛意／我對自己無能為力", "B": "兩個人一輩子不分離／你問我好在那裡／不是你不期待永恆的戀曲／你說最\n美的愛情叫做回憶", "C": "記得要忘記／忘記／我提醒自己／你已經是人海中的一個背影／長長時光／\n我應該要有新的回憶", "D": "親愛的你／我知道你會哭泣／面對回憶／我們還擁有過去／不要問我為什麼\n／我們承認吧／我們的愛情已遠離\n- 3 -\n94學年度 第 4 頁\n國文考科 共 7 頁\n貳 、 多 選 題 ： （ 佔 24分 ）"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "14-15", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A（或C）", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 40.0, "B": 33.0, "C": 13.0, "D": 13.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 57.0, "B": 29.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 9.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 25.0, "B": 34.0, "C": 24.0, "D": 17.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 40.0, "p_high": 57.0, "p_low": 24.0, "discrimination": 33.0, "p_quintiles": [62.0, 48.0, 39.0, 31.0, 21.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測94-chinese-016", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 16, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列各組文句，「」內字義相同的選項是：", "options": {"A": "不貪於財，不「苟」於利／「苟」非其人，道不虛行", "B": "闔門懸車，不「豫」政事／凡事「豫」則立，不豫則廢", "C": "攜朋挈儔，去故「就」新／望之不似人君，「就」之而不見所畏焉", "D": "超然而上，「薄」乎雲霄，而不以為喜也／今者「薄」暮，舉網得魚，巨口\n細鱗，狀似松江之鱸", "E": "猶之用人，非畜道德者，「惡」能辨之不惑，議之不徇／夫上以至誠行之，\n而貴者知避上之所「惡」矣"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 17.0, "B": 62.0, "C": 56.0, "D": 60.0, "E": 28.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 5.0, "B": 60.0, "C": 72.0, "D": 63.0, "E": 15.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 32.0, "B": 59.0, "C": 41.0, "D": 57.0, "E": 40.0}, "omit_rate": 1.0, "p_value": 23.0, "p_high": 36.0, "p_low": 13.0, "discrimination": 23.0, "p_quintiles": [41.0, 27.0, 20.0, 15.0, 12.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測94-chinese-017", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 17, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "陶淵明〈歸去來辭〉一文中「策扶老以流憩」的「扶老」一詞是指「柺杖」，\n「扶」是動詞，「老」是名詞，「扶老」為一動賓（即動詞＋受詞）結構，但\n是整個詞結合起來作為名詞用。下文「」中的語詞，也具有同樣語法結構的選\n項是：", "options": {"A": "不惜歌者苦，但傷「知音」稀", "B": "正是江南好風景，「落花」時節又逢君", "C": "「屏風」有意障明月，燈火無情照獨眠", "D": "喉間猶是哽咽，心上還是亂跳，「枕頭」上已經濕透，肩背身心，但覺冰冷", "E": "有了「靠山」做主，就是八隻腳的螃蟹一般，豎了兩個大鉗，只管橫行將去"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 74.0, "B": 59.0, "C": 43.0, "D": 60.0, "E": 88.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 93.0, "B": 44.0, "C": 60.0, "D": 79.0, "E": 95.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 50.0, "B": 71.0, "C": 30.0, "D": 38.0, "E": 77.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 28.0, "p_high": 49.0, "p_low": 9.0, "discrimination": 40.0, "p_quintiles": [55.0, 37.0, 26.0, 16.0, 6.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測94-chinese-018", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 18, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "「流行」一詞本有各種不同的意義，今日則最常用於說明某些人、事、物在一\n個特定時期與地區之中，受到眾人共同喜好、關注的程度，例如「流行歌」、「流\n行服飾」等。下列文句中「流行」一詞，與上述意義相同的選項是：", "options": {"A": "天災流行，國家代有。救災、恤鄰，道也。行道有福", "B": "習慣如自然，則莫非天理之流行而仁熟矣。聖賢同歸", "C": "孔子曰：「德之流行，速於置郵而傳命。」當今之時，萬乘之國行仁政，民\n之悅之，猶解倒懸也", "D": "劉兄……在任逾歲，職修人治，州中稱無事。頗復增飾，從子弟而游其間；\n又作二十一詩以詠其事，流行京師，文士爭和之", "E": "時世粧，時世粧，出自城中傳四方。時世流行無遠近，顋不施朱面無粉。烏\n膏注唇唇似泥，雙眉畫作八字低。妍蚩黑白失本態，粧成盡似含悲啼"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 20.0, "B": 24.0, "C": 56.0, "D": 76.0, "E": 88.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 8.0, "B": 19.0, "C": 50.0, "D": 92.0, "E": 95.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 32.0, "B": 29.0, "C": 56.0, "D": 56.0, "E": 78.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 42.0, "p_high": 58.0, "p_low": 26.0, "discrimination": 32.0, "p_quintiles": [63.0, 50.0, 42.0, 33.0, 22.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測94-chinese-019", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 19, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "儒家認為一個人的外在行止不唯與其內在修養相符相應、相生相成，抑且是禮\n義之道的開端，所以儒家極重視外在行止的講求。下列文句表現儒家此種觀點\n的選項是：", "options": {"A": "外貌斯須不莊不敬，而易慢之心入之矣", "B": "禮義之始，在於正容體，齊顏色，順辭令", "C": "學有所得，不必在談經論道間，當於行事動容周旋中禮者得之", "D": "臨民之時，容止可觀，進退可度，語言和謹，處事安詳，則不失其禮體矣", "E": "君子所貴乎道者三：動容貌，斯遠暴慢矣；正顏色，斯近信矣；出辭氣，斯\n遠鄙倍矣\n- 4 -\n第 5 頁 94學年度\n共 7 頁 國文考科"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 43.0, "B": 91.0, "C": 78.0, "D": 88.0, "E": 74.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 53.0, "B": 98.0, "C": 88.0, "D": 95.0, "E": 88.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 33.0, "B": 80.0, "C": 66.0, "D": 78.0, "E": 57.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 45.0, "p_high": 62.0, "p_low": 25.0, "discrimination": 37.0, "p_quintiles": [65.0, 55.0, 47.0, 37.0, 18.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測94-chinese-020", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 20, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列關於「經」、「傳」的敘述，正確的選項是：", "options": {"A": "孔子的著作稱「經」；仲尼弟子的著作稱「傳」", "B": "《詩經》中的《雅》、《頌》是「經」；《國風》是「傳」", "C": "《春秋》是「經」；《左氏》、《公羊》、《穀梁》是「傳」", "D": "六經亦稱「六藝」，指《詩》、《書》、《禮》、《樂》、《易》、《春秋》六部經典", "E": "《論語》、《孟子》本非「經」，後世才升格為「經」，可見經、傳的地位\n並非固定不變"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 18.0, "B": 22.0, "C": 81.0, "D": 80.0, "E": 60.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 9.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 86.0, "D": 80.0, "E": 77.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 27.0, "B": 35.0, "C": 72.0, "D": 78.0, "E": 40.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 47.0, "p_high": 65.0, "p_low": 27.0, "discrimination": 38.0, "p_quintiles": [69.0, 58.0, 49.0, 38.0, 21.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測94-chinese-021", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 21, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列作品、作家、時代及體裁，對應完全正確的選項是：", "options": {"A": "〈虯髯客傳〉╱元稹╱唐人傳奇小說", "B": "《水滸傳》／施耐庵／宋人話本小說", "C": "《老殘遊記》／劉鶚╱清代章回小說", "D": "《聊齋誌異》╱蒲松齡╱清代志怪小說", "E": "《世說新語》╱劉義慶╱南朝宋志人小說"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 30.0, "B": 36.0, "C": 85.0, "D": 84.0, "E": 70.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 18.0, "B": 24.0, "C": 90.0, "D": 91.0, "E": 84.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 39.0, "B": 46.0, "C": 81.0, "D": 71.0, "E": 52.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 44.0, "p_high": 64.0, "p_low": 23.0, "discrimination": 41.0, "p_quintiles": [69.0, 54.0, 43.0, 33.0, 18.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測94-chinese-022", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 22, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "文中的「激情原人」發現小花兒的美麗，內心激動，於是用枯枝、石片、土塊\n拼組成文字，這就是「創作」的開始。下列文字說明創作的起源與「激情原人」\n情形相似的選項是：", "options": {"A": "言氣質，言神韻，不如言境界。有境界，本也；氣質、神韻，末也，有境界\n而二者隨之矣", "B": "春秋代序，陰陽慘舒，物色之動，心亦搖焉。……歲有其物，物有其容；情\n以物遷，辭以情發", "C": "夫街談巷說，必有可采；擊轅之歌，有應風雅。匹夫之思，未易輕棄也。辭\n賦小道，固未足以揄揚大義，彰示來世也", "D": "氣之動物，物之感人，故搖蕩性情，形諸舞踊。……若乃春風春鳥，秋月秋\n蟬，夏雲暑雨，冬月祁寒，斯四候之感諸詩者也", "E": "文以氣為主，氣之清濁有體，不可力強而致。譬諸音樂，曲度雖均，節奏同\n檢，至於引氣不齊，巧拙有素，雖在父兄，不能以移子弟\n- 5 -\n94學年度 第 6 頁\n國文考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "22-23", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 45.0, "B": 82.0, "C": 23.0, "D": 82.0, "E": 11.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 35.0, "B": 94.0, "C": 15.0, "D": 96.0, "E": 4.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 52.0, "B": 65.0, "C": 31.0, "D": 65.0, "E": 19.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 51.0, "p_high": 70.0, "p_low": 31.0, "discrimination": 39.0, "p_quintiles": [74.0, 61.0, 51.0, 40.0, 26.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測94-chinese-023", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 23, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列關於引文中兩種「原人」的說明，正確的選項是：", "options": {"A": "「冥思原人」的行為無異於剽竊「激情原人」的文學情懷，據為己有，這樣\n的海盜行為實為出版人之恥", "B": "「激情原人」的癡情與癲狂，見證了人類有一種超越衣食慾望的需求，那種\n需求是人類美好的本質之一", "C": "「冥思原人」屬於統治階級，和「激情原人」不同，不需要狩獵，因而有閒\n暇可以思考創作與出版的問題", "D": "「冥思原人」能欣賞「美」，並且努力的將其傳播給更多的人―― 這隱然揭\n示了一個出版人應有的心懷與責任", "E": "文中說「冥思原人」的「那滴淚是文明的源頭」，可以滋潤「所有乾燥的內\n在」，表現了出版事業對文明發展與文化傳承的重大意義\n第二部分：非選擇題（共三大題，佔 54 分）"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "22-23", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 4.0, "B": 89.0, "C": 10.0, "D": 86.0, "E": 88.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 98.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 96.0, "E": 97.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 7.0, "B": 75.0, "C": 19.0, "D": 71.0, "E": 75.0}, "omit_rate": 1.0, "p_value": 77.0, "p_high": 93.0, "p_low": 54.0, "discrimination": 39.0, "p_quintiles": [95.0, 90.0, 84.0, 74.0, 42.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
